# global-arret-fixed: Is a fixed quantity named arret a global target, so that the action does not stop the run (XPPAUT 8.2.2)?
# xpp: rows=6
# pc: ODE0058
# ruling: A fixed quantity cannot be assigned, so the name keeps its meaning as the stop action.
x'=1
x(0)=0
arret=x+1
global 1 x-0.55 {arret=1}
@ total=2,dt=0.1,meth=euler
